# U8 (MODEL-FUZZY, I13): fx v0.0.16's model search, rule by rule, on a catalog
# made for it (p5-input-model-rank.json; f9ddaff8, matchModelQuery and the
# three ranks, src/core/app/model_cache_runtime.zig:340-447@481104fd).
# The menu lists it gpt-5, opus-4.8, gpt4omni, gpt5-lite, gpt-4.5-preview,
# sonnet-4.5, DeepSeekCoder (picker order, `model`).
# - q-gpt5: the three ranks -- gpt5-lite has `gpt5` as typed, gpt-5 has it once
#   the dash is dropped, gpt-4.5-preview has its letters in order from a word
#   start -- each ahead of the next, whatever the catalog order.
# - q-gpt-5-words: every word found once punctuation is dropped, so all three
#   rank the same and keep the catalog's order.
# - q-omi / q-mi: a word starts where letters turn into digits (`gpt4omni`:
#   gpt, 4, omni), so `omi` finds it and `mi` does not; q-dsc / q-sc: a case
#   change is not a word start (`DeepSeekCoder` is one word).
# - q-sonnet-opus: every word must match. q-punct (`. /`): words with no
#   letter or digit are dropped, and a query of only those finds nothing
#   unless an id holds it as typed. q-anth-slash: a lone `/` word is dropped.
# - q-padded / q-blank: the blanks round the query are not part of it, and a
#   blank query lists everything.
# - q-gpt5-openai / -all / -down / -enter: the tabs filter the ranked list, and
#   Enter takes the marked row of the ranked list.
# - c-*: the `/model <query>` column ranks the same way and Enter takes its
#   first row (modelCompletions, :897-913). A space typed there is not
#   inserted unless it follows a model's exact id (app_input_runtime.zig:
#   1355-1363, advanceModelPickerOnSpace, input_completion_runtime.zig:
#   1210-1219), so `anthropic opus` typed reads `anthropicopus` (fuzzy); the
#   c-paste-* snaps paste the line, spaces kept.
fx: env FX_AUTO_UPGRADE=0
models p5-input-model-rank.json
wait 4
type /model
key Enter
wait 2
snap model
type gpt5
wait 0.8
snap q-gpt5
key C-u
type gpt 5
wait 0.8
snap q-gpt-5-words
key C-u
type omi
wait 0.8
snap q-omi
key C-u
type mi
wait 0.8
snap q-mi
key C-u
type dsc
wait 0.8
snap q-dsc
key C-u
type sc
wait 0.8
snap q-sc
key C-u
type sonnet opus
wait 0.8
snap q-sonnet-opus
key C-u
type . /
wait 0.8
snap q-punct
key C-u
type anthropic / sonnet
wait 0.8
snap q-anth-slash
key C-u
type   Claude-Sonnet
key Space Space
wait 0.8
snap q-padded
key C-u
key Space Space Space
wait 0.8
snap q-blank
key C-u
type anthropic sonet
wait 0.8
snap q-sonet
key C-u
type gpt5
key Tab Tab
wait 0.8
snap q-gpt5-openai
key BTab BTab
wait 0.8
snap q-gpt5-all
key Down
wait 0.8
snap q-gpt5-down
key Enter
wait 1.5
snap q-gpt5-enter
type /model gpt5
wait 1
snap c-gpt5
key Down
wait 0.6
snap c-gpt5-down
key Tab
wait 0.8
snap c-gpt5-tab
key C-u
type /model anthropic opus
wait 0.8
snap c-anthropic-opus
key C-u
type /model gpt5 lite
wait 0.8
snap c-gpt5-lite
key C-u
type /model mi
wait 0.8
snap c-mi
key C-u
paste /model gpt 5
wait 0.8
snap c-paste-gpt-5
key C-u
paste /model anthropic opus
wait 0.8
snap c-paste-anthropic-opus
key C-u
type /model cs45
wait 0.8
snap c-cs45
key Enter
wait 1.5
snap c-cs45-enter
